        "subject": "LU-20940 dkms: build after DOCA's mlnx-ofa_kernel",
        "message": "LU-20940 dkms: build after DOCA's mlnx-ofa_kernel\n\nSince DOCA 3.2.0, the EL packages ship the OFED kernel modules\nas the DKMS module mlnx-ofa_kernel. BUILD_DEPENDS has only the\nDebian name mlnx-ofed-kernel, so after a kernel update DKMS may\nbuild Lustre before the OFED modules for that kernel.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testgroup=full-dkms\nFixes: 77cc4d2ffac6 (\"LU-19553 dkms: inject depends on other dkms packages\")\nSigned-off-by: Markus Hilger <markus.hilger@megware.com>\nChange-Id: I7cb2d6b5899c047344faeec865f8e25f10032e0c\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
